# The Institutional Magnet (QM5_3005)

VWAP Pullback with Macro Trend Filter.

Timeframe: H1.

## Rules

### Entry

On H1, enter long when EMA(50) is above EMA(200) and price pulls back to the current session's Daily VWAP.

### Baseline
Long if 50 EMA > 200 EMA

### Confirmation
Price pulls back to Daily VWAP

### Exit
Daily High.

### Stop Loss

The source gives no explicit stop. The V5 build should add a conservative catastrophic `2.0 * ATR(14)` stop.

### Target Symbols

EURUSD.DWX, GBPUSD.DWX, USDJPY.DWX, XAUUSD.DWX, NDX.DWX, and WS30.DWX.
